                "word": "tarantella",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "934d69a8-a203-4348-87e0-b66d6167c019",
                        "entry_id": "0db78a5f-5f40-37e8-a56a-a3e9322e28bc",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "tarantellas"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7505219d-d976-37c2-b65d-428218fa55ab",
                        "entry_id": "0db78a5f-5f40-37e8-a56a-a3e9322e28bc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A rapid dance in 6/8 time, originating in Italy, or a piece of music for such a dance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7af75924-bad0-454c-858f-0849c2cac719",
                                "sense_id": "7505219d-d976-37c2-b65d-428218fa55ab",
                                "text": "The set in which they found themselves was composed of English, and Amy was compelled to walk decorously through a cotillion, feeling all the while as if she could dance the tarantella with relish."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "94a2ad54-cc0f-486c-950e-3721400fe2bd",
                                "sense_id": "7505219d-d976-37c2-b65d-428218fa55ab",
                                "text": "\"A tarantella, I presume?\" blandly suggested the doctor.\nMiss Mannersley stopped, and rose carelessly from the piano. \"It is a Moorish gypsy song of the fifteenth century,\" she said dryly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "295543f9-9624-443b-b2b8-e73f730a2a03",
                                "sense_id": "7505219d-d976-37c2-b65d-428218fa55ab",
                                "text": "We learn to understand why our addled minds seize so little with precision, why they are caught up and tossed about in a kind of tarantella by headlines and catch-words, why so often they cannot tell things apart or discern identity in apparent differences."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e96b9870-f07f-427e-91be-7975f686d6cf",
                        "source_entry_id": "0db78a5f-5f40-37e8-a56a-a3e9322e28bc",
                        "source_sense_id": "7505219d-d976-37c2-b65d-428218fa55ab",
                        "source_sense_description": "rapid dance",
                        "target_lang_word": "tarentelle",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tarentelle",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ee4b0bfb-c457-3e27-9ad1-5f951c4cee4d",
                                        "entry_id": "bed15e1d-bc9b-393f-bff6-7b6b2d382b7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Danse, d’un mouvement vif et ardent, du sud de l’Italie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4dc68f5-bf92-4dc3-98e1-2fbe72903c0f",
                                                "sense_id": "ee4b0bfb-c457-3e27-9ad1-5f951c4cee4d",
                                                "text": "Il suffit de trois petits bonds\nC´est tout de suite la tarentelle"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4767834e-8c47-4301-968b-e2f967e81c4f",
                                                "sense_id": "ee4b0bfb-c457-3e27-9ad1-5f951c4cee4d",
                                                "text": "Le premier soir, un Italien de la Banque Mondiale, découragés par les effets des politiques de son organisme, dansait la tarentelle au bar du quatrième."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "684a71c8-59be-34a8-8fa6-1b92db1eeee5",
                                        "entry_id": "bed15e1d-bc9b-393f-bff6-7b6b2d382b7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Musique accompagnant la danse du même nom."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69978bd9-25c9-49ee-b630-23b7b5c6282c",
                                                "sense_id": "684a71c8-59be-34a8-8fa6-1b92db1eeee5",
                                                "text": "Tantôt venant d’Espagne et tantôt d’Italie\nTous chargés de parfums, de musiques jolies\nLe Mistral et la Tramontane\nSur mon dernier sommeil verseront les échos\nDe villanelle, un jour, un jour de fandango\nDe tarentelle, de sardane"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
